18
00:01:13,879 --> 00:01:18,039
However, by dent of beating about a little in the dark, and now and then

19
00:01:18,040 --> 00:01:22,278
knocking up a peaceable inhabitant to inquire the way, we at last came to

20
00:01:22,279 --> 00:01:24,919
