70
00:05:16,680 --> 00:05:21,798
Fishiest of all fishy places was the tripods, which welld deserved its name,

71
00:05:21,799 --> 00:05:26,119
for the pots there were always boiling chowters. Chowder for breakfast and

72
00:05:26,120 --> 00:05:29,638
chowder for dinner and chowder for supper till you began to look for

73
00:05:29,639 --> 00:05:32,119
