74
00:05:32,120 --> 00:05:37,078
The area before the house was paved with clamshells. Mrs. Hussie wore a polished

75
00:05:37,079 --> 00:05:41,958
necklace of codfish vertebrae, and Hosea Hussie had his account books bound in

76
00:05:41,959 --> 00:05:46,679
superior old shark skin. There was a fishy flavor to the milk, too, which I

77
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:50,519
could not at all account for, till one morning, happening to take a stroll

78
00:05:50,520 --> 00:05:55,477
along the beach among some fisherman's boats, I saw Hosea's brindled cow

79
00:05:55,478 --> 00:05:59,798
