86
00:06:28,040 --> 00:06:32,839
Stigs, coming from that unfortunate voyage of his, when he was gone four

87
00:06:32,840 --> 00:06:38,039
years and a half with only three barrels of, was found dead in my first floor

88
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:42,759
back with his harpoon in his side. Ever since then, I allow no borders to take

89
00:06:42,760 --> 00:06:47,638
such dangerous weapons in their rooms at night. So, Mr. Quiquake, for she had

90
00:06:47,639 --> 00:06:51,798
